    "title": "Lisa, 40 Years at Hannaford - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lori Arsenault ,\n12 hours ago Thanks to a story idea from Hannaford customer and 20-year Gorham resident Corinne Altham, we learned that 2026 is Lisa King’s 40th year working at Hannaford. Anyone who shops at Hannaford regularly will have, at some point, had their groceries packed neatly and efficiently by Lisa. Add to that her warm and cheerful smiles and greetings, she is well-deserving of this recognition. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
